SUMMARY:Susto (solo) with special guest Daniel Ray Hillsinger
LOCATION:Drom\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:SUSTO (Solo) - Justin Osborne is a singer\, songwriter\, and st
 
oryteller best known as the founder and frontmanof SUSTO. Since founding th
 
e band in 2013 while living in Havana\, Cuba\, Osborne has built anexpansiv
 
e catalog rooted in deeply personal lyricism and a sound that moves between
 
 SouthernGothic\, folk\, rock\, country\, and psychedelia.Across SUSTO\, th
 
e roots-oriented Susto Stringband\, and his solo performances\, Osborne'sso
 
ngwriting remains the throughline---confessional\, searching\, and shaped b
 
y love\, loss\,change\, resilience\, and the strange beauty of everyday lif
 
e. Performing solo brings those songsback to their foundation\, putting Osb
 
orne's voice\, lyrics\, and storytelling front and center andoffering an in
 
timate look at the songwriter behind the catalog. Daniel Ray Hillsinger Web
 
site - https://danielrayhilsinger.com/ Spotify - https://open.spotify.com/a
 
rtist/0ZugMhJumMgfKPfAXFzLNU IG - https://www.instagram.com/danielrayhilsin
 
ger/ Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/susto-solo-with-specia
 
l-guest-drom-tickets/14312354
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/susto-solo-with-special-guest-drom-tick
 
ets/14312354
END:VEVENT
