SUMMARY:Aladdin
LOCATION:New Amsterdam Theatre\, Midtown-Times Square
DESCRIPTION:Sherri Shepherd joins ALADDIN as Genie from October 16\, 2026\,
 
 through January 3\, 2027. She has scheduled absences for the October 17 ma
 
tinee\, October 18 matinee\, November 1 matinee and evening\, and November 
 
